{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1161515-masks","id":1161515,"title":"Masks","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-11-22T07:39:01-08:00","id":1161515,"title":"Masks","content":"Hey ho. <br /> <br /> Super excited about the 2e kickstarter that's underway, and browsing the draft got me thinking.<br /> <br /> Do changelings' masks resemble who they were before? <br /> <br /> Reason I ask, is if I was snatched, and replaced with a fetch, when I got back as a Changeling, are there now 2 versions of me rambling around the place, as far as Joe Shmoe is concerned?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3192-baileyborough","name":"baileyborough","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-22T08:20:37-08:00","id":1161523,"title":"","content":"I don't know fully know for sure, but how I read it is that it varies. I think the mask approximates the Mein into a human face. And most likely your Mein incorporates some of your previous facial features. <br /> <br /> So for the most part, your Mask would look pretty similar to your old self (or Fetch). Your hair might be thinner and brittle feeling since you're Mein's hair is covered with lifeless leaves. Or your forehead maybe more pronounced since your Mein has large sawed off horns. <br /> <br /> But Changelings are weird and there's no gaurentee that you kept the same features at all. So I guess it really depends on how you want to play out the drama of the story since it could go either way (the Mirror Masks specifically say they can mold their mask and may not even remember what you used to look like at all)<br /> <br /> So all n' all: It varies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-22T11:50:58-08:00","id":1161573,"title":"","content":"Masks traditionally just hide the fae features with the nearest mortal equivalent. If you mostly look like your old self, then yes. If you've been changed (younger, older, different gender, different skin tone/hair color, etc) then the Mask will reflect those changes.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-22T14:32:53-08:00","id":1161612,"title":"","content":"Mask will look as close to 'you' as possible, taking in account changes made by Seeming. Without those changes, you would look <i><b>exactly </b></i>like in the moment of abduction. HOWEVER, changes of Kith and Seeming are <i>very</i> large - antlers, hooves, fur, becoming like 70 year old crone, setting ones aflame, etc. - those things <b>will</b> show up as closest normal looking feature. If you are remade into stone body - in Mask your character will look as she took few dozen extra pounds of muscle. Her hairs of fire will become normal red hairs. And a like.<br /> <br /> In the end - changeling looks like previous person he was has come on drastic, life altering appearance changes. Like he joined sect or tried to rework his image completely. Think of Sydney Bristow from <b>Alias</b> series in her many disguises - but in the same time she IS the same person. Only that changeling can <i>also </i>become larger, smaller, older, younger and a like radical differences between him now and before Durance.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=joo4kwYYROc\" data-code=\"joo4kwYYROc\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/joo4kwYYROc/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 11-22-2017, 05:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-14T20:24:28-08:00","id":1167823,"title":"","content":"Your mask is representative of how you see yourself. So while it SHOULD look like how you were before that isn't always the case and changes are going to take place regardless. Perhaps minor changes that could be accounted for age, but changes none the less.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5610-aslan751","name":"aslan751","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5610_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}